### Environment
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Root / Welcome Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. POST /register/ - Register a new user (Success)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "suresh",
  "name": "Suresh Kumar",
  "password": "suresh@password123"
}

### 3. POST /register/ - Duplicate username (Failure: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "suresh",
  "name": "Suresh Duplicate",
  "password": "suresh@password123"
}

### 4. POST /register/ - Missing fields (Failure: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "incomplete_user"
}

### 5. POST /login/ - Successful Login (Returns jwt_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "suresh",
  "password": "suresh@password123"
}

### 6. POST /login/ - Unknown User (Failure: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "non_existent_user",
  "password": "anypassword"
}

### 7. POST /login/ - Incorrect Password (Failure: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "suresh",
  "password": "wrongpassword123"
}

### 8. GET /users/ - Verify database stores hashes only
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/

